// BarChart 的具名分组视觉由 UIX 唯一拥有；Rust 内核负责数据、分组/堆叠、缩放、平移、刷选和绘制执行。
<Visual
  name="BAR_CHART_DEFAULTS_VISUAL"
  type="BarChartDefaultsVisual"
  width={300.0}
  height={200.0}
  showValue={true}
  barRadius={2.0}
  barGap={0.2}
  categoryGap={0.2}
  padding={0.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="BAR_CHART_LAYOUT_VISUAL"
  type="BarChartLayoutVisual"
  titleHeight={20.0}
  subtitleHeight={16.0}
  legendRowHeight={18.0}
  legendSideRatio={0.24}
  legendSideMin={64.0}
  legendSideMax={120.0}
  yLabelWidth={36.0}
  yLabelWidthRatio={0.35}
  categoryLabelHeight={14.0}
  valueLabelHeight={14.0}
  plotBottomGap={4.0}
  gridMinSpacing={30.0}
  gridMinLines={bar_chart_grid_min_lines(4)}
  minValueLabelExtent={10.0}
  centerRatio={0.5}
/>

<Visual
  name="BAR_CHART_CHROME_VISUAL"
  type="BarChartChromeVisual"
  axisStroke={1.0}
  gridStroke={0.5}
  crosshairStroke={1.0}
  brushAlpha={48}
  labelGap={4.0}
  valueGap={2.0}
  tooltipOffset={12.0}
  tooltipPadding={4.0}
  tooltipEdgeInset={4.0}
  tooltipBorder={1.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="BAR_CHART_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL"
  type="BarChartTypographyVisual"
  title={15.0}
  subtitle={11.0}
  grid={9.0}
  value={10.0}
  category={10.0}
  tooltip={10.0}
  legend={10.0}
  seriesSeparator="  "
  singleSeriesLegend="数据"
/>

<Visual
  name="BAR_CHART_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="BarChartPaletteVisual"
  background={bar_chart_background_color()}
  text={bar_chart_text_color()}
  textSecondary={bar_chart_secondary_text_color()}
  border={bar_chart_border_color()}
  primary={bar_chart_primary_color()}
  elevated={bar_chart_elevated_color()}
/>

<Visual
  name="BAR_CHART_VISUAL"
  type="BarChartVisual"
  defaults={BAR_CHART_DEFAULTS_VISUAL}
  layout={BAR_CHART_LAYOUT_VISUAL}
  chrome={BAR_CHART_CHROME_VISUAL}
  typography={BAR_CHART_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL}
  palette={BAR_CHART_PALETTE_VISUAL}
/>

<KernelView value={build_bar_chart_view(kernel, BAR_CHART_VISUAL_REF)} />
